  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1512.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1512.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish a process for eligible projects to obtain a permit by notification (PBN), pursuant to RSA 485-A:17, in lieu of a standard AOT permit, while ensuring compliance with environmental protection standards.\n\nSource. #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html"
}
